      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "STEP 1 — CLINICAL EXTRACTOR :8100 (LangGraph)\n\nGraph: discover → fetch_prompt → harvest → parse×3 → assemble\n\nMCP calls:\n  ① clinical_watcher (Roots: Data/incoming/)\n  ② MCP Prompt: discharge-extraction-prompt\n  ③ clinical_data_harvester ×3 (doctor, lab, bill)\n\nOutput: ClinicalRecord JSON\nSQLite: EXTRACTED",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "bx11",
      "originalText": "STEP 1 — CLINICAL EXTRACTOR :8100 (LangGraph)\n\nGraph: discover → fetch_prompt → harvest → parse×3 → assemble\n\nMCP calls:\n  ① clinical_watcher (Roots: Data/incoming/)\n  ② MCP Prompt: discharge-extraction-prompt\n  ③ clinical_data_harvester ×3 (doctor, lab, bill)\n\nOutput: ClinicalRecord JSON\nSQLite: EXTRACTED",
      "lineHeight": 1.2,
      "index": "tbx11"
    },
