      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "STEP 2 — CLINICAL NORMALIZER :8102 (LangGraph)\n\nGraph: detect → translate? → expand abbrev → score confidence\n\nMCP calls:\n  ① medical_lang_bridge (if not English)\n  ② MCP SAMPLING → Normalizer callback → LiteLLM\n     • Non-English → Bedrock Nova Lite\n     • English → Cohere Command R+\n\nOutput: English JSON + translation_confidence\nIf confidence < 0.70 → finding → may escalate\nSQLite: NORMALIZED",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "bx12",
      "originalText": "STEP 2 — CLINICAL NORMALIZER :8102 (LangGraph)\n\nGraph: detect → translate? → expand abbrev → score confidence\n\nMCP calls:\n  ① medical_lang_bridge (if not English)\n  ② MCP SAMPLING → Normalizer callback → LiteLLM\n     • Non-English → Bedrock Nova Lite\n     • English → Cohere Command R+\n\nOutput: English JSON + translation_confidence\nIf confidence < 0.70 → finding → may escalate\nSQLite: NORMALIZED",
      "lineHeight": 1.2,
      "index": "tbx12"
    },
