      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "STEP 3 — CLINICAL VALIDATOR :8101 (LangGraph)\n\nGraph: load_rules → completeness → cross_validate → score → decide\n\nMCP calls:\n  ① MCP Resource: clinical-rules (completeness + cross-validation)\n  ② clinical_rules_engine (+ MCP ELICITATION = HITL-1)\n  ③ ehr_validation → Mock EHR REST :8050\n     GET /patients/{id}/bundle, allergies, meds, labs\n  ④ calculate_risk_score (Analytics MCP :8201)\n\nEHR checks: allergy conflict, med omission, diagnosis,\nfollow-up, abnormal labs, discharge approval, bill payment\n\nRisk bands: Low≤2, Medium≤8, High>8\nSQLite: VALIDATED",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "bx14",
      "originalText": "STEP 3 — CLINICAL VALIDATOR :8101 (LangGraph)\n\nGraph: load_rules → completeness → cross_validate → score → decide\n\nMCP calls:\n  ① MCP Resource: clinical-rules (completeness + cross-validation)\n  ② clinical_rules_engine (+ MCP ELICITATION = HITL-1)\n  ③ ehr_validation → Mock EHR REST :8050\n     GET /patients/{id}/bundle, allergies, meds, labs\n  ④ calculate_risk_score (Analytics MCP :8201)\n\nEHR checks: allergy conflict, med omission, diagnosis,\nfollow-up, abnormal labs, discharge approval, bill payment\n\nRisk bands: Low≤2, Medium≤8, High>8\nSQLite: VALIDATED",
      "lineHeight": 1.2,
      "index": "tbx14"
    },
