      "originalText": "STEP 4 — AUDIT REPORT (MCP Tool, not agent)\n\nMCP call:\n  ① clinical_insight_reporter\n\nGenerates:\n  • audit.json\n  • audit.html (Jinja2 template from MCP Resource)\n  • audit.pdf (WeasyPrint)\nSaved: data/reports/{case_id}/\nSQLite: REPORTED",
