      "originalText": "STEP 5 — RAG INDEXING :8105 (Agno)\n\nRuns for ALL cases (including blocked!)\n\nRoles:\n  ① Indexing: chunk record → embed (all-MiniLM-L6-v2)\n  ② Store in FAISS: data/vector_db/\n\nAfter this: Clinical Q&A page works\nSQLite: INDEXED",
