      "versionNonce": 1,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "STEP 6 — ESCALATION GATE (GuardrailManager)\n\ncheck_hitl_escalation(risk_level, discharge_blocked)\n\nEscalate to HITL if ANY:\n  • discharge_blocked = true\n  • risk_level = High\n  • Critical rule fired (e.g. allergy conflict)\n  • Low translation confidence\n\n→ HITL_PENDING  OR  → SUMMARY_READY\n⚠ Summary is NOT auto-generated here!",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "bx22",
      "originalText": "STEP 6 — ESCALATION GATE (GuardrailManager)\n\ncheck_hitl_escalation(risk_level, discharge_blocked)\n\nEscalate to HITL if ANY:\n  • discharge_blocked = true\n  • risk_level = High\n  • Critical rule fired (e.g. allergy conflict)\n  • Low translation confidence\n\n→ HITL_PENDING  OR  → SUMMARY_READY\n⚠ Summary is NOT auto-generated here!",
      "lineHeight": 1.2,
      "index": "tbx22"
    },
