      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "SUMMARY GENERATOR :8104 (ADK, streaming)\n\n• Fetches MCP Prompt: summary-generation-prompt\n• Streams sections via A2A /message:stream:\n  1.About your stay  2.Medications\n  3.Lab results  4.Bill  5.Instructions\n• Toxicity guardrail per section\n• Saves to SQLite → status CLOSED",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "bx33",
      "originalText": "SUMMARY GENERATOR :8104 (ADK, streaming)\n\n• Fetches MCP Prompt: summary-generation-prompt\n• Streams sections via A2A /message:stream:\n  1.About your stay  2.Medications\n  3.Lab results  4.Bill  5.Instructions\n• Toxicity guardrail per section\n• Saves to SQLite → status CLOSED",
