      "originalText": "RAG Q&A :8105 (anytime after INDEX)\n\nQuestion → Prompt injection guard\n→ Retrieve (FAISS top-k)\n→ Augment (re-rank)\n→ Generate (MCP rag-answer-prompt)\n→ Reflect (RAG Triad)\nFaithfulness < 0.7 → BLOCK answer",
